(- Simplicity: Easy to set up and use, making it ideal for beginners and) Tj T*
(  small-scale projects.) Tj T*
(- Portability: The entire database is stored in a single file, which can be) Tj T*
(  easily copied, moved, or shared.) Tj T*
(- Reliability and speed: Despite its compact size, SQLite offers strong) Tj T*
